- *     kada_starter_yearly   — Starter plan, billed annually
- *     kada_growth_monthly   — Growth plan, billed monthly
- *     kada_growth_yearly    — Growth plan, billed annually
- *
- *   iOS (App Store):
- *     kada_starter_monthlyios — Starter plan, billed monthly
- *     kada_starter_yearlyios  — Starter plan, billed annually
- *     kada_growth_monthlyios  — Growth plan, billed monthly
